This keyword specifies the RBD group name for the image.

On provision, the group will be created if it doesn't exist, and the image will be added to the group if it's not already a member.

On status, a warning will be logged if the group doesn't exist or the image is not in the group.

On unprovision, the image will be removed from the group, and the group will be removed if it becomes empty.

Value format: a simple group name string.